<p class="hygen-product__lede">
  The Clot Satchel is a transformable piece crafted from two full sheets of blood-dyed lambskin. A vertical wrap system shifts the silhouette under tension—from an oversized satchel into a dense, compressed form that echoes a blood clot.
</p>

