        <h3 class="hygen-product__block-title">Production</h3>
        <p>Every Clot Satchel is handcrafted individually in our atelier in Singapore.</p>
        <p>Two full sheets of lambskin form the body, with raw hide edges left intentionally exposed. The wrapping strap is patchworked from scrap remnants of the same hides, keeping waste close to zero.</p>
        <p>Due to the nature of the leather, no two bags will ever be the same.</p>
