        <h3 class="hygen-product__block-title">About</h3>
        <p>The Clot Satchel is designed to shift between an oversized satchel and a compressed form. Its vertical wrap system alters the silhouette under tension—when tightened, the bag collapses into a dense, croissant-like mass.</p>
        <p>Emphasis on exposed raw hide edges runs throughout the construction, celebrating the material’s honesty and the hand that shaped it.</p>
